      {
        "level": 1,
        "name": "Primal Mystic",
        "description": "<p>You can Cast Spells using Survival.</p><p><strong>Spells:</strong> You learn 2 Spells, one of which must always be Polymorph. You learn 1 other Spell every 3 Levels hereafter.</p><p><strong>Mana:</strong> Your Max Mana is equal to (2 × your Level), and your Cast Max for Spells is equal to (1 + half your Level, round up).</p>",
